   are placed in their cells as Ghostty places them.
 - `terminal_scroll_speed`: wheel and trackpad multiplier (default 1, clamped
   to 0.1..5), including mouse reports to programs. Small moves accumulate.
+- Optional `colors.terminal_bg_RRGGBB` entries map exact program background
+  colors to theme colors at paint time. Existing cells refresh live; removing
+  a rule restores their original colors. Text on mapped surfaces keeps its
+  color when readable, otherwise blends toward theme foreground for 4.5:1
+  contrast. Selection, reverse video and graphic glyphs are excluded.
+  Example: `"terminal_bg_292929": "#f1dfbd"`. These opt-in rules apply
+  to every terminal in this theme, not only a particular CLI.
 - `font` / `font_size`: the terminals' (px at zoom 1); `ui_font`: the mods'
   (their text sizes are their own, in px, and follow zoom). Optional: without
   them a layout uses settings.json's, else Herdr's (JetBrains Mono 14, Geist).
